6T342 195T359 133Q359 71 321 31T198 -10H190Q138 -10 94 26L86 19L77 10Q71 4 65 -1L54 -11H46H42Q39 -11 33 -5V74V132Q33 153 35 157T45 162H54Q66 162 70 158T75 146T82 119T101 77Q136 26 198 26Q295 26 295 104Q295 133 277 151Q257 175 194 187T111 210Q75 227 54 256T33 318Q33 357 50 384T93 424T143 442T187 447H198Q238 447 268 432L283 424L292 431Q302 440 314 448H322H326Q329 448 335 442V310L329 304H301Q295 310 295 316Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"945\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2674\" y=\"598\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"2511\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"3306\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"4307\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"5085\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6141,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-63\" x=\"839\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"1283\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2602\" y=\"598\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"8602\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"9174\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Using the above, we rewrite the integral and evaluate it, as follows:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"60.469ex\" height=\"68.134ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -33.275ex; margin-bottom: -0.229ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -14909.9 26035.1 29335.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\t\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\int_{\\ln 3}^{\\ln 6} \\dfrac{\\csch{x}}{\\coth^2{x} - 1} \\, \\textrm{d}x\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\int_{\\ln 3}^{\\ln 6} \\dfrac{\\csch{x}}{\\csch^2{x}} \\, \\textrm{d}x <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\int_{\\ln 3}^{\\ln 6} \\sinh{x} \\, \\textrm{d}x <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\cosh{x} \\Big|_{\\ln 3}^{\\ln 6}<span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\cosh(\\ln 6) - \\cosh(\\ln 3)<span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\left(\\dfrac{e^{\\ln 6}+e^{-\\ln 6}}{2}\\right) - \\left(\\dfrac{e^{\\ln 3}+e^{-\\ln 3}}{2}\\right)<span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\left(\\dfrac{6 + \\dfrac{1}{6}}{2}\\right) - \\left(\\dfrac{3 + \\dfrac{1}{3}}{2}\\right)<span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\dfrac{37}{12} - \\dfrac{5}{3}<span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\t&amp;= \\dfrac{37}{12} - \\dfrac{20}{12} <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n            &amp;= \\dfrac{17}{12}\n\t}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJSZ2-222B\" d=\"M114 -798Q132 -824 165 -824H167Q195 -824 223 -764T275 -600T320 -391T362 -164Q365 -143 367 -133Q439 292 523 655T645 1127Q651 1145 655 1157T672 1201T699 1257T733 1306T777 1346T828 1360Q884 1360 912 1325T944 1245Q944 1220 932 1205T909 1186T887 1183Q866 1183 849 1198T832 1239Q832 1287 885 1296L882 1300Q879 1303 874 1307T866 1313Q851 1323 833 1323Q819 1323 807 1311T775 1255T736 1139T689 936T633 628Q574 293 510 -5T410 -437T355 -629Q278 -862 165 -862Q125 -862 92 -831T55 -746Q55 -711 74 -698T112 -685Q133 -685 150 -700T167 -741Q167 -789 114 -798Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-6C\" d=\"M42 46H56Q95 46 103 60V68Q103 77 103 91T103 124T104 167T104 217T104 272T104 329Q104 366 104 407T104 482T104 542T103 586T103 603Q100 622 89 628T44 637H26V660Q26 683 28 683L38 684Q48 685 67 686T104 688Q121 689 1